            <li><strong>Arrangement Layers</strong>: Vocals, drums, bass, guitar, keyboard — who takes front stage, who yields space.</li>
            <li><strong>Picture via Instrumentation</strong>: Build space through acoustic arrangements rather than ambiguous prompt adjectives.</li>
            <li><strong>Two-Mix Comparison</strong>: Drowned vocal vs clear front vocal. Judging strictly audible vs inaudible.</li>
            <li><strong>Finalizing Checklist</strong>: What to keep, what to cut, when to stop. Conquering infinite blind generation through human editorial authority.</li>
