            </p>
            <ol class="space-y-1 text-slate-400 pl-2">
              <li>• <strong>Lecture 1 (Sep 12)</strong>: Getting the model to sing your lyrics accurately (Concluded)</li>
              <li>• <strong>Lecture 2 (Sep 26)</strong>: Keeping accompaniment from overpowering vocals (Concluded)</li>
              <li>• <strong>Lecture 3 (Oct 10)</strong>: Chinese vocal timbre and traditional instruments (Concluded)</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-purple-300">Grand Finale (Oct 24)</strong>: <span class="text-white font-semibold">Arrangement Layers and Final Delivery (Merged Lecture 4 & 5 · Recording & Slides Live)</span></li>
            </ol>
