          <p class="font-bold text-white">Speakers</p>
          <p>• <strong>Instructor</strong>: Michael Huo (Chairman, VI AI Foundation & VI AI for Good Foundation; Founding VP, ZJUAA NC; Chairman, NACUAA AI Club)</p>
